WEBVTT


00:00:00.280 --> 00:00:02.920
can you please take down the garbage once

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:04.800
the garbage is still in the kitchen

00:00:05.240 --> 00:00:07.960
I told you I'd do it in a minute

00:00:08.680 --> 00:00:10.840
you know what really hurts me about it

00:00:11.560 --> 00:00:12.360
not the garbage

00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:14.760
but that I always have the feeling

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:16.800
I have to remind you of everything

00:00:17.320 --> 00:00:20.880
do you know this feeling write it in the comments

00:00:21.280 --> 00:00:22.680
and I just think

00:00:22.880 --> 00:00:24.000
I will do it later

00:00:24.480 --> 00:00:25.280
you know what

00:00:25.760 --> 00:00:28.440
I now understand why this hurt you so much

00:00:28.880 --> 00:00:31.640
but for you it was 1 sign that I listen to you

00:00:32.280 --> 00:00:33.400
that's exactly what I meant

00:00:34.120 --> 00:00:35.760
thank you for understanding me now

00:00:37.880 --> 00:00:39.920
many disputes in relationships

00:00:40.080 --> 00:00:41.960
do not arise because of the matter itself

00:00:42.240 --> 00:00:45.240
but because of the meaning the other sees in it

00:00:45.480 --> 00:00:46.880
when someone speaks up to something

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:48.680
it is often not about the task

00:00:48.800 --> 00:00:49.600
but therefore

00:00:49.720 --> 00:00:53.040
to be seen follow for the next situation tomorrow

00:00:53.080 --> 00:00:55.160
you definitely know these
